.\" Manpage for Vltimate CV
.TH VLTIMATE-CV 1 "November 2026" "v4.0.0" "Vltimate CV Manual"
.SH NAME
vltimate-cv \- Proof-of-Work Technical Harvester, Strict ATS Resume Engine & Zero-Trust Exporter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vltimate-cv
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Vltimate CV
scans local git repositories, shell histories, developer tooling, and public developer registries to build an evidence-backed knowledge base (\fBoutput/raw_technical_profile.md\fR), render strict single-column ATS or ModernCV bilingual HTML/PDF resumes (\fBoutput/cv.html\fR), and export secret-redacted JSON/TOON profiles for optional Vltimate Studio cloud tailoring.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage and options summary.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Print ISO timestamps and detailed trace output.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-log
View the latest execution log file in terminal.
.TP
.BR \-k ", " \-\-db ", " \-\-knowledge
View the technical knowledge database in terminal.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-add\-source " \fI<TARGET>\fR"
Add a custom scrapable directory path, URL, or note.
.TP
.BR \-\-provider " \fI<agy|gemini|openai|anthropic|ollama>\fR"
Select BYOK or local LLM backend (default: \fBagy\fR).
.TP
.BR \-\-model " \fI<MODEL>\fR"
Override default model for the selected provider.
.TP
.BR \-\-layout " \fI<ats|moderncv>\fR"
Select strict single-column linear ATS layout (\fBats\fR, default) or two-column split margin (\fBmoderncv\fR).
.TP
.BR \-\-export\-profile
Redact secrets/paths and export structured JSON and TOON files.
.TP
.BR \-\-push " \fI<STUDIO_URL>\fR"
Export sanitized profile and sync it to Vltimate Studio.
.TP
.BR \-\-license\-key " \fI<KEY>\fR"
Validate and store a Lemon Squeezy Pro license key locally.
.TP
.BR \-\-simple\-glyphs ", " \-\-rich\-glyphs
Force single-width fallback glyphs or color emojis.
.TP
.BR \-\-view
Open the local preview HTML resume in a detected browser.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tailor " \fI<FILE|URL>\fR"
Tailor summary, keywords, and STAR-K bullets to a job description.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pdf
Force headless PDF generation (\fBcv_en.pdf\fR and \fBcv_pl.pdf\fR).
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-diff
Generate \fBharvest_diff.log\fR comparing baseline and current runs.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-interactive
Enable interactive refinement loop.
.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-encrypt\-mode " \fI<aes|gpg>\fR"
Select archive encryption backend (\fBaes\fR or \fBgpg\fR).
.TP
.BR \-\-gui
Open customization GUI in browser.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config
Reconfigure GitHub handle, provider, and encrypted vault sync.

.SH FILES
.I config/user_constraints.md
Gitignored user-specific exclusions and language rules loaded dynamically.
